{"id": "EUVD-2026-104298", "enisaUuid": "d4239706-6ef7-3e14-9b56-76c6967449d4", "description": "Netpbm through 11.16.00 contains a heap out-of-bounds write vulnerability in the rasttopnm Sun rasterfile run-length decoder pr_load_image in converter/other/rast.c. Attackers can supply a byte-encoded rasterfile with tiny dimensions and a long run-length body to write controlled bytes past md_image, causing memory corruption and crashes.", "datePublished": "2026-10-19T13:55:22", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T16:34:48", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:L/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haindpwn/netpbm-sunraster-rle-oob-write-palette-oob-read", "https://sourceforge.net/p/netpbm/code/5400/tree/advanced/converter/other/rast.c", "https://sourceforge.net/p/netpbm/code/5400/tree/super_stable/converter/other/rast.c", "https://netpbm.sourceforge.net/", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/netpbm-through-11.16.00-heap-out-of-bounds-write-via-rasttopnm-pr-load-image"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-112275", "GHSA-g5r3-p9v9-9mrm"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "27f0e1ce-7344-3352-9442-699a3277afb3", "product": {"name": "netpbm", "vendor": {"name": "Netpbm"}}, "product_version": "0 \u226411.16.00"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "137f780a-ab35-352d-822c-70da4620cfde", "vendor": {"name": "Netpbm"}}], "isExploited": false}